# Local working notes. Not secret, but this repo is public and CONTEXT.md is an
# index of unfixed security defects — a roadmap is more useful to an attacker
# than the same holes sitting quietly in source. Revisit once the blocking set
# in it is closed. The pre-commit hook also refuses it, in case of `git add -f`.
CONTEXT.md

